  "text": "735kg Reclaimed 29 | 10 | 2025 What if every time we built a home, local communities benefitted too? That’s exactly what happened when Studio Rovik collaborated with Goldenb Earth Studio and opened their doors to London creatives to collect freshly excavated clay straight from their site. In just one week, 42 creatives signed up and 735kg of clay was saved from landfill, bagged up and taken back to studios across the city to be given a new life. A huge thank you to Vivek for joining Golden Earth Studio in our mission to make waste accessible. The incredible response shows just how valued secondary resources are, and why we need to do more to keep materials in circulation across construction sites.",
